+Feature: Editing mode hides other controls
+  As a user editing a todo
+  I want other controls hidden during editing
+  So that I can focus on the edit without distraction
+
+  Scenario: Toggle and destroy controls are hidden during editing
+    Given a todo titled "Buy milk" exists
+    When the user double-clicks the "Buy milk" todo label
+    Then the "Buy milk" todo is in editing mode
+    And the toggle checkbox is hidden during editing
+    And the destroy button is hidden during editing
